        78.23609924316406,
        389.1797180175781,
        273.0215759277344,
        403.62274169921875
      ],
      "text": "A child is a person under 10 years of age.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
